# The Curse's static is a CantBlockBy with no ValidAttacker$, so it applies to
# every attacker and restricts only ValidBlocker$ Creature.EnchantedBy. Grizzly
# Bears (power 2) attack; the enchanted Hill Giant (toughness 2) could not
# block them, but the unenchanted Silvercoat Lion can, and the 2/2s trade.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 4=1
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
# One more advance for the state-based-action check that kills both.
advance
